{"story":{"group_1":[{"autoTurnLast":0.01,"bg":"bg_adv_21593.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":390100,"motion":0,"pos":2},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_051.exp3.json","id":200700,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"bgm":"bgm03_story13","chara":[{"id":390100,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"Yuu","textRight":"Nice to meet you! I'm Yuu.@I'm a Magical Girl, just like you.","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"id":200700,"motion":400}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"A...Magical Girl?!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_014.exp3.json","id":390100,"motion":1}],"nameRight":"Yuu","textRight":"That's right~. I made a contract with Kyubey@and everything!"},{"chara":[{"id":200700,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"..."},{"chara":[{"id":200700,"lipSynch":0,"motion":300}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"(Come to think of it...)"},{"chara":[{"id":200700,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"(She'd be awfully conversational for a Witch...)"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":200700,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"S-still, your magic is really..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":390100,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"Yuu","textRight":"What about it?"},{"chara":[{"id":200700}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"It's weird, is what it is!@For a Magical Girl, you're just so..."},{"chara":[{"id":390100,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"Yuu","textRight":"Just so what?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":200700,"motion":1,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"I mean... You even look like a monster."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":200700,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"(That, and her presence is really something else...)"},{"chara":[{"id":390100,"motion":400}],"nameRight":"Yuu","textRight":"A-a MONSTER?!@[chara:390100:lipSynch_0][wait:1.2][chara:390100:lipSynch_1][chara:390100:cheek_0][chara:390100:face_mtn_ex_030.exp3.json]How terrible!"},{"chara":[{"id":390100}],"nameRight":"Yuu","textRight":"You know you shouldn't make fun of people@for the way they look, right?"},{"chara":[{"id":390100,"lipSynch":0}],"nameRight":"Yuu","textRight":"...[wait:0.8][chara:390100:lipSynch_1][chara:390100:cheek_0][chara:390100:face_mtn_ex_050.exp3.json][chara:390100:motion_100]Wait, did I take that the wrong way?@Maybe you meant it as a compliment?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":200700,"motion":300}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"...I did not."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_014.exp3.json","id":390100,"motion":1}],"nameRight":"Yuu","textRight":"I'm so happy... I made a new friend."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":200700,"motion":400}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"Since when the heck were we friends?!"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":200700,"motion":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":390100,"motion":1}],"nameNarration":"","narration":"<The conversation between the two@was terribly arduous.>","narrationBg":"bg_adv_21593.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"narration":"<Eventually, however...>"},{"chara":[{"id":200700,"motion":300}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","narrationEffect":"out","textLeft":"F-fine, I get it... I don't have to give up;@I just have to accept it."},{"chara":[{"id":200700}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"You do seem kinda Magical Girl-ish, since..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":390100,"motion":400,"pos":2},{"eyeClose":0,"id":200700}],"nameRight":"Yuu","textRight":"Huh? I thought I just told you that I am@a Magical Girl?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":390100}],"nameRight":"Yuu","textRight":"Maybe I didn't, though...?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":390100,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"Yuu","textRight":"Nice to meet you! I'm Yuu.@I'm a Magical Girl, just like you."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":200700,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textBg":"shout","textLeft":"[chara:200700:effect_emotion_angry_0][se:7219_strain]AAAAAAAGH!@You're driving me crazy!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_060.exp3.json","id":200700}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"This whole thing is making my head spin!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_014.exp3.json","id":390100,"motion":1}],"nameRight":"Yuu","textRight":"I'm so happy... I made a new friend!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":200700,"motion":1}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"But..."},{"chara":[{"id":200700,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"(She is highly intriguing...)"},{"chara":[{"id":200700,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"(No... If I were to compromise and take the@perspective that she is a Magical Girl,)"},{"chara":[{"id":200700,"lipSynch":0,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"(I don't think there's anyone who wouldn't@find her intriguing!)"},{"chara":[{"id":200700,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"(I mean, what the heck is her deal...?)"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":200700,"lipSynch":0,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"(Is she...actually a Magical Girl?)"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":390100,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"Yuu","textRight":"What's your na—"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":200700,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"My name? Nagisa here is under no obligation@to disclose that!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":390100,"motion":400}],"nameRight":"Yuu","textRight":"Right, right, of course! Nagisa!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_051.exp3.json","id":200700,"motion":400}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"[chara:200700:effect_emotion_surprise_0][se:7226_shock]...Ack! I blew it...!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_014.exp3.json","id":390100,"motion":1}],"nameRight":"Yuu","textRight":"Ahehe...@That's right; it was Nagisa!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":200700,"lipSynch":0,"motion":300}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"(What in the...@I have no idea how to pin her.)"},{"chara":[{"id":200700,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"(She's shockingly friendly, too!)"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":200700,"lipSynch":0,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"(Never before has any iteration of me)"},{"chara":[{"id":200700,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"(seen such a unique Magical Girl...)"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":200700,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_051.exp3.json","id":200700,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"(Do you think, perhaps...)"},{"chara":[{"id":200700,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"(She could be connected to \"those\" matters...?)"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_033.exp3.json","id":200700,"motion":300}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"Uh... Yew? Yuu?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":390100,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"Yuu","textRight":"Whaaat?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":200700}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"I'm...gonna stick with you for a little bit!"},{"chara":[{"id":390100}],"nameRight":"Yuu","textRight":"Eh?"},{"chara":[{"id":200700,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"I wanna know more about you!@Who you are and stuff!"},{"chara":[{"id":200700}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"The free-wheeling Nagisa does as she pleases!@Even if you refuse, I'll—!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":390100,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"Yuu","textRight":"Sure, that's fine."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":200700,"motion":300,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Nagisa","textLeft":"...She caved immediately..."},{"autoTurnLast":2.0,"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"}]},"version":3}
